    </thead><tbody>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1091405">F3 0F 59 /r</para>
      <para unique="1091406">MULSS xmm1,xmm2/m32</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091410">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091412">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091414">SSE</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091416">Multiply the low single precision floating-point value in xmm2/m32 by the low single precision floating-point value in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1091418">VEX.LIG.F3.0F.WIG 59 /r</para>
      <para unique="1091419">VMULSS xmm1,xmm2, xmm3/m32</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091423">B</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091425">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091430">AVX</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091432">Multiply the low single precision floating-point value in xmm3/m32 by the low single precision floating-point value in xmm2.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1091875">EVEX.LLIG.F3.0F.W0 59 /r</para>
      <para unique="1091876">VMULSS xmm1 {k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m32 {er}</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091880">C</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091882">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091887">AVX512F</para>
      <para unique="1091891">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+258755"/> </para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091893">Multiply the low single precision floating-point value in xmm3/m32 by the low single precision floating-point value in xmm2.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    </tbody>
